WEBVTT

00:08.675 --> 00:16.716
Shiroi mikazuki machi wo miorosu koro ni

00:16.716 --> 00:24.714
Aoi meikyuu kara mashou ga mezame-hajimeru

00:32.232 --> 00:36.036
Tsumibukai kono chijou de, boy

00:36.036 --> 00:39.039
Believing, dreaming

00:39.039 --> 00:42.876
Boku-tachi wa sagashiteru

00:42.876 --> 00:48.007
Tamashii no mezasubeki basho wo

00:49.816 --> 00:58.224
Ah, dore kurai fukai yami hikari ni kaetara

00:58.224 --> 01:02.796
Sekai no iro ga kawaru?

01:02.796 --> 01:05.465
Ah, itsuka kitto

01:05.465 --> 01:13.740
Ah, dore kurai fukai nazo ikutsumo toitara

01:13.740 --> 01:18.700
Rakuen no doa wa hiraku?

01:20.246 --> 01:26.879
Bokura no tabi wo start hajimeyou

01:39.165 --> 01:42.328
We've gathered quite a lot of
evil energy, haven't we?

01:44.037 --> 01:47.996
How many more must be lit before I can
return to the world of the gods?

01:52.979 --> 01:58.611
The 12th Night
The Traps of Castle Dracula

02:14.968 --> 02:16.836
Way to go, Loki!

02:16.836 --> 02:19.100
Huh. Not bad, Detective.

02:19.439 --> 02:22.575
That's the first time I've seen anyone
get a perfect on that stage!

02:22.575 --> 02:24.372
Excellent as always, Master Loki.

02:25.345 --> 02:27.040
It's no big deal.

02:27.280 --> 02:29.949
What's the problem?
Wasn't it any fun for you?

02:29.949 --> 02:31.849
Don't you like Living Dead Hunter?

02:32.886 --> 02:35.753
It's the most popular game at our arcade!

02:36.089 --> 02:37.522
Huh. Really?

02:37.991 --> 02:41.950
As an employee, I just don't feel
quite as confident anymore.

02:42.328 --> 02:45.632
But now we know that if we're
ever attacked by zombies,

02:45.632 --> 02:48.931
all we need to do is give Loki
a gun and we'll be just fine!

02:49.903 --> 02:55.637
Listen, Mayura, you can't beat a real
zombie with a toy gun like this.

02:56.075 --> 02:58.270
Divine protection is another story, though.

02:59.279 --> 03:00.746
I see.

03:01.247 --> 03:03.816
It sounds like you've actually run
into real zombies before.

03:03.816 --> 03:05.218
Yeah, well...

03:05.218 --> 03:06.845
By the way, where's Reiya?

03:07.420 --> 03:09.752
She was over by the
UFO Catchers a minute ago.

03:10.390 --> 03:12.187
Loki!

03:14.627 --> 03:16.652
Look what I won!

03:17.497 --> 03:19.863
That's quite a prize you got for yourself.

03:20.233 --> 03:21.598
Yeah!

03:22.268 --> 03:23.970
Well then, maybe it's about
time we head back.

03:23.970 --> 03:24.971
Sure!

03:24.971 --> 03:26.268
Hold on.

03:27.440 --> 03:30.510
Leaving now would only mean
leaving unsatisfied, right?

03:30.510 --> 03:32.740
Let me show you our special item.

03:33.246 --> 03:34.713
Your special item?

03:34.981 --> 03:36.816
Yes, our latest product.

03:36.816 --> 03:39.580
I think it would be enough
to entertain even you.

03:40.153 --> 03:42.288
You have something like that?
I want to see it!

03:42.288 --> 03:43.423
Don't you, Loki?

03:43.423 --> 03:44.424
Not really.

03:44.424 --> 03:47.126
C'mon, don't be shy.
I guarantee you'll enjoy it.

03:47.126 --> 03:48.561
Then it's decided!

03:48.561 --> 03:50.085
All right, this way.

03:51.197 --> 03:52.687
Oh, brother...

03:55.301 --> 03:57.269
I'm scared!

03:57.704 --> 03:59.639
Well? It's something, isn't it?

03:59.639 --> 04:02.267
Yeah, it sure is! Mystery!

04:02.609 --> 04:04.310
What is all this?

04:04.310 --> 04:06.813
The Kakinouchi Group exerted
its influence to obtain

04:06.813 --> 04:10.350
this collection of vampire-related
items from around the world.

04:10.350 --> 04:12.875
Oh? Vampires, huh?

04:13.553 --> 04:18.183
This is a cursed, blood-sucking dagger
which was found in a castle in Romania.

04:18.558 --> 04:20.355
Huh. It says...

04:21.361 --> 04:23.556
"Made in China."

04:27.367 --> 04:28.857
This lamp!

04:29.502 --> 04:31.137
You've got a sharp eye.

04:31.137 --> 04:33.106
That was purchased at a London
auction for the bargain price of...

04:33.106 --> 04:33.640
980 yen, right?
That was purchased at a London
auction for the bargain price of...

04:33.640 --> 04:35.241
980 yen, right?

04:35.241 --> 04:38.210
I saw this in a mail-order catalog
and wanted to get one myself!

04:39.746 --> 04:43.011
Master Loki, don't you think this would
go nicely in the dining room?

04:43.249 --> 04:45.308
This is what you wanted to show me?

04:46.753 --> 04:48.653
Well, the main attraction...

04:51.691 --> 04:55.662
is this virtual reality-based
vampire action game!

04:55.662 --> 04:58.130
It's called "Castle Dracula"!

04:58.231 --> 05:00.631
Wow! Sounds mysterious!

05:01.234 --> 05:04.637
We plan to unveil it at our
next promotional event.

05:04.637 --> 05:07.299
It looks awesome! I want to try it!

05:07.640 --> 05:11.878
You're in for a surprise. The setting
for the game is an old castle

05:11.878 --> 05:14.914
that completely captures the mood
and feel of the real thing.

05:14.914 --> 05:16.905
This is one intense game.

05:21.321 --> 05:22.655
I'll put it this way;

05:22.655 --> 05:24.757
all of the beta testers got so absorbed
in this game that, one by one,

05:24.757 --> 05:26.626
they all broke down and
were laid up in bed.

05:26.626 --> 05:29.395
Wow, it's that awesome?!

05:29.395 --> 05:33.855
Yeah. Well, the truth is I haven't
actually played it yet.

05:36.169 --> 05:38.905
Hey, Loki, who do you want to go first?

05:38.905 --> 05:40.673
Doesn't really matter to me.

05:40.673 --> 05:42.197
Loki...

05:43.042 --> 05:46.603
I think this place is kind of scary.

05:46.913 --> 05:50.683
I see. You want to go back and play
those other games, do you?

05:50.683 --> 05:52.014
Yes!

05:52.685 --> 05:54.354
Hey, what about this one?

05:54.354 --> 05:56.589
You can go first, Mayura.

05:56.589 --> 05:58.079
Huh? Really?

05:58.925 --> 06:01.027
You go first then, Daidoji.

06:01.027 --> 06:02.895
I'll get it ready right now.

06:02.895 --> 06:04.829
Thanks! Me first.

06:07.967 --> 06:10.197
Two cats and two goats.

06:11.304 --> 06:13.864
I'll discard this one, and...
okay, you're on!

06:14.273 --> 06:16.241
Ah, I'll take that!

06:16.909 --> 06:18.342
What? Again?

06:19.145 --> 06:20.813
I've got two bears!

06:20.813 --> 06:22.303
In that case...

06:24.484 --> 06:26.219
Ooh! I'll take that one too!

06:26.219 --> 06:28.153
Wait, now hold on a moment!

06:28.888 --> 06:30.323
I win!

06:30.323 --> 06:33.156
Bear, bear, pig, bear! Yay!

06:35.328 --> 06:37.853
You're too tough, Reiya!

06:41.801 --> 06:43.996
Huh? It won't come on.

06:44.337 --> 06:47.738
That's funny. It's plugged in and everything...

06:48.341 --> 06:50.710
Wait here a minute. I'll go get the manual.

06:50.710 --> 06:51.768
Uh, okay.

06:56.115 --> 06:58.317
I want to play it quick.

06:58.317 --> 07:00.376
Like, "game start"!

07:02.088 --> 07:03.885
Huh? It came on.

07:15.468 --> 07:18.096
Sorry to keep you waiting, Daidoji.

07:19.272 --> 07:21.263
Huh? Daidoji?

07:22.542 --> 07:23.600
Daidoji?

07:25.244 --> 07:26.506
It's working.

07:27.480 --> 07:29.315
That was fun!

07:29.315 --> 07:30.950
You sure are good at that game, Reiya!

07:30.950 --> 07:32.785
I'm sorry, Master Loki.

07:32.785 --> 07:34.821
Once we get home, I'll register in one
of those correspondence courses

07:34.821 --> 07:36.322
to learn more about this game.

07:36.322 --> 07:37.619
I'll be much better next time we play.

07:38.224 --> 07:40.658
Hey, have you seen Daidoji around?

07:41.060 --> 07:44.188
What? Isn't she playing that Dracula game?

07:44.530 --> 07:47.192
Well, she just disappeared all of a sudden.

07:47.733 --> 07:49.836
I wonder if she went home.

07:49.836 --> 07:51.971
Without even playing the game?

07:51.971 --> 07:56.032
I'll bet you she found some weird thing
and went chasing after it.

07:56.375 --> 07:57.672
"Mystery!"

07:58.277 --> 07:59.574
Like that, right?

07:59.979 --> 08:01.848
Oh, right. Yeah, maybe she did.

08:01.848 --> 08:04.976
All right, Loki, you try it first then.
It's all set up.

08:05.218 --> 08:06.719
Ah, but...

08:06.719 --> 08:10.556
I'm going home in a little bit, Loki.

08:10.556 --> 08:12.683
I had so much fun!

08:13.259 --> 08:16.422
Oh yeah? Okay, I'll see you out.

08:16.829 --> 08:19.059
I'll be over in a little bit, Kotaro.

08:19.265 --> 08:21.563
Okay. Be quick, though.

08:24.403 --> 08:25.870
Kotaro?

08:32.311 --> 08:33.608
This is...

08:38.217 --> 08:39.275
It couldn't be!

08:42.522 --> 08:44.217
Where am I?

08:48.060 --> 08:49.829
What the heck is going on?!

08:49.829 --> 08:51.694
Mayura! Kotaro!

08:54.767 --> 08:57.203
Master Loki, what on earth...

08:57.203 --> 08:59.569
They're both inside the game.

08:59.972 --> 09:03.032
Does this mean the game has
been possessed by evil?

09:03.509 --> 09:06.307
But I didn't sense this presence
when we saw it earlier.

09:06.879 --> 09:10.349
Probably because it hadn't
been switched on.

09:10.349 --> 09:13.876
Our enemy no doubt resides
within the program itself.

09:14.420 --> 09:16.388
What should we do?

09:16.722 --> 09:18.019
I'll go.

09:18.190 --> 09:19.592
Master Loki!

09:19.592 --> 09:22.425
I'll go inside the machine and
bring the other two back out.

09:23.162 --> 09:24.993
You wait here, Yamino.

09:25.965 --> 09:26.932
But...

09:27.667 --> 09:28.964
Leave it to me.

09:33.072 --> 09:34.403
Master Loki!

10:03.569 --> 10:05.264
My, what poor taste.

10:07.206 --> 10:10.664
Now then, where could those two be?

10:18.684 --> 10:21.915
So you're going to be courteous
and guide me, eh?

10:36.669 --> 10:38.569
Be careful, Detective!

10:46.746 --> 10:48.145
Kotaro!

11:01.027 --> 11:02.119
Kotaro!

11:05.731 --> 11:07.631
It's no use, Loki!

11:08.034 --> 11:10.662
It's game over for me.

11:10.836 --> 11:12.064
Where's Mayura?

11:12.672 --> 11:14.173
I don't know.

11:14.173 --> 11:16.709
The game was never supposed
to have been this real!

11:16.709 --> 11:17.943
Indeed.

11:17.943 --> 11:20.413
So are those things the enemy?

11:20.413 --> 11:21.846
Yeah.

11:23.115 --> 11:27.916
This game takes people the players know
and turns them into enemies.

11:28.320 --> 11:31.551
In your case, high school girls?

11:31.991 --> 11:33.185
Get off it!

11:33.626 --> 11:35.821
I'll find some way to help you!

11:36.529 --> 11:37.496
Loki!

11:38.130 --> 11:39.256
Behind you!

11:44.970 --> 11:46.597
Yamino?

11:48.474 --> 11:49.998
"Yamino"?

11:50.376 --> 11:54.836
I'd appreciate it if you'd address me
more respectfully, as an adult.

11:56.382 --> 11:58.451
What are you saying, Yamino?

11:58.451 --> 12:01.253
I thought I told you to address
me more respectfully.

12:01.253 --> 12:04.814
People who won't listen need
to be taught a lesson.

12:05.124 --> 12:07.393
You're acting kind of weird.

12:07.393 --> 12:09.361
Well don't just stand there!

12:09.695 --> 12:11.925
Smash that red stone he's wearing!

12:12.264 --> 12:13.458
Red stone?

12:15.835 --> 12:16.893
That?

12:17.470 --> 12:20.496
If you can defeat the boss of each stage...

12:22.308 --> 12:23.172
Kotaro!

12:23.676 --> 12:25.644
Defeat the last boss, Dracula!

12:25.644 --> 12:27.202
I know you can do it!

12:36.355 --> 12:38.084
Time to start the game.

12:46.132 --> 12:48.734
So what you're saying is,
if I want to save those two...

12:48.734 --> 12:51.032
I need to beat the game, right?

12:51.370 --> 12:52.705
That is correct.

12:52.705 --> 12:55.230
However, it won't be as easy as you think.

12:59.912 --> 13:01.573
Yes, yes, wonderful.

13:01.914 --> 13:03.415
You mock me.

13:03.415 --> 13:06.578
Well how do you like this?

13:07.253 --> 13:09.050
Yamino 100 Splitting Fists!

13:16.629 --> 13:19.097
In that case, how about this?

13:19.365 --> 13:20.957
Ultimate Secret Technique:

13:23.135 --> 13:25.296
Yamino Swan Fist!

13:25.638 --> 13:28.038
This imposter is too hasty.

13:30.643 --> 13:33.703
I only need to break the red stone, right?

13:38.517 --> 13:40.186
It can't be!

13:40.186 --> 13:44.885
Not after I trained so hard with the "Macho
Worker" that I bought through mail-order!

13:53.699 --> 13:55.860
I guess that means I've cleared the stage.

14:04.677 --> 14:06.304
I've been waiting for you.

14:07.947 --> 14:09.073
Freya?

14:11.784 --> 14:15.743
I am so happy to see you, my lord.

14:16.055 --> 14:17.352
"My lord"?

14:17.890 --> 14:19.959
She doesn't have a red stone.

14:19.959 --> 14:21.256
What's going on?

14:25.364 --> 14:28.333
Here you go. Please take a break.

14:28.500 --> 14:32.459
Uh, thanks, but I don't really have the time.

14:33.038 --> 14:34.903
What did you say?

14:35.074 --> 14:37.872
My tea's not good enough for you?

14:38.277 --> 14:40.108
That's what you mean to say, isn't it?

14:40.512 --> 14:44.107
No! No one ever said that!

14:52.157 --> 14:54.785
Prepare yourself, Loki!

14:54.960 --> 14:55.984
Reiya?!

14:56.562 --> 14:58.621
Now, hold on a second, Reiya!

15:03.168 --> 15:06.939
Loki! Aren't you willing to
let me cut you down?

15:06.939 --> 15:08.907
Of course not!

15:09.675 --> 15:11.575
You're so mean!

15:13.545 --> 15:16.482
It's not fair for you to keep
dodging me like that!

15:16.482 --> 15:20.386
It's not like I can attack Reiya,
even if I'm supposed to...

15:20.386 --> 15:23.355
Then stay put and die!

15:26.592 --> 15:28.560
Oh, no...

15:32.598 --> 15:35.066
She destroyed herself. What a relief!

15:39.571 --> 15:41.766
You're late, Loki!

15:42.374 --> 15:43.976
Narugami.

15:43.976 --> 15:46.645
So you're my opponent on this stage?

15:46.645 --> 15:47.880
Quite right.

15:47.880 --> 15:50.212
I will pound you with the hammer of justice.

15:50.516 --> 15:51.717
Justice?

15:51.717 --> 15:53.485
But you're the bad guy.

15:53.485 --> 15:56.181
Enough talk! Have at you, Loki!

15:56.755 --> 15:58.484
Whatever...

15:58.691 --> 16:00.225
That thing doesn't suit you.

16:00.225 --> 16:01.460
Quiet.

16:01.460 --> 16:05.794
Now witness the magnificent dance of
Mjolnir, the supreme sword of justice!

16:06.899 --> 16:08.367
What's the matter, Loki?

16:08.367 --> 16:10.892
You don't have to hold back just
because it's me, you know.

16:11.870 --> 16:14.373
When it comes to combat, there is
no such thing as mercy!

16:14.373 --> 16:16.170
Oh yeah? Then I won't hold back.

16:18.377 --> 16:20.675
Only a coward would fire
suddenly like that, Loki!

16:21.480 --> 16:25.712
Good grief. How many of these
stages are there anyway?

16:26.352 --> 16:28.183
Say, "ahhh."

16:30.889 --> 16:32.356
Heimdall.

16:33.759 --> 16:36.228
This is the 4th stage, right?

16:36.228 --> 16:37.997
Of course it is!

16:37.997 --> 16:39.794
Hey, you mind if I don't fight you?

16:41.000 --> 16:42.334
Of course not!

16:42.334 --> 16:46.532
As long as you're happy,
that's good enough for me.

16:48.907 --> 16:51.273
Come on now! Eat it up!

16:59.018 --> 17:00.519
You are creeping me out!

17:00.519 --> 17:03.886
It'd be much better if you'd just attack me!

17:04.723 --> 17:06.691
You're so cruel.

17:12.564 --> 17:14.900
I wish you'd stop playing around.

17:14.900 --> 17:17.801
I want to rescue Mayura and the others
and get out of here quickly.

17:20.139 --> 17:22.937
Well met, Loki!

17:25.077 --> 17:29.314
The most clever, most powerful
villain always comes last.

17:29.314 --> 17:31.009
It's the way of the game!

17:31.350 --> 17:34.853
So long as this utterly invincible bastion
of power beyond all compare,

17:34.853 --> 17:40.259
namely the mighty Frey and the elite
Gullinbursti squad, stands in your way,

17:40.259 --> 17:43.595
Oh, I see. So this is the end then?
You shall not be allowed even a
single step beyond this point.

17:43.595 --> 17:45.531
You shall not be allowed even a
single step beyond this point.

17:45.531 --> 17:46.732
With that in mind...

17:46.732 --> 17:48.100
Bravo.
With that in mind...

17:48.100 --> 17:49.499
Go, Gullin...

17:50.903 --> 17:54.202
I hadn't even finished my line!

18:01.213 --> 18:03.738
So are you finally going to show yourself?

18:09.021 --> 18:15.551
...for richer or for poorer,
in sickness and in health...

18:20.365 --> 18:22.333
Mayura! Kotaro!

18:23.702 --> 18:27.604
They don't have the red stones.
Which means it's really them?

18:28.040 --> 18:32.568
Have you also come to see these two
receive this holiest of sacraments?

18:32.911 --> 18:38.144
Stop fooling around and
return them immediately.

18:38.517 --> 18:44.183
They shall receive God's blessing
and live in a land of happiness.

18:44.656 --> 18:46.325
A land of happiness?

18:46.325 --> 18:48.260
You mean inside this game?

18:48.260 --> 18:51.530
This is a timeless land,
blessed by the Almighty.

18:51.530 --> 18:52.831
These two are...

18:52.831 --> 18:55.800
You have no right to speak of gods, you devil!

18:56.368 --> 19:00.031
Now why don't you stop the act
and reveal your true form?

19:08.881 --> 19:13.409
Fool! You, too, shall give your blood
unto me and be my servant!

19:14.820 --> 19:17.618
You still want to continue this farce?

19:18.757 --> 19:20.088
Go!

19:21.126 --> 19:22.684
Mayura! Kotaro!

19:24.496 --> 19:26.832
Loki, you're going to join us!

19:26.832 --> 19:28.333
Don't put up a fight!

19:28.333 --> 19:30.028
Wake up, you two!

19:31.570 --> 19:34.273
The fresh blood of one young person
after another is brought before me,

19:34.273 --> 19:36.275
and all I must do is await its arrival.

19:36.275 --> 19:38.777
You shall never have my castle!

19:38.777 --> 19:41.713
So that's why you possessed this game?

19:41.713 --> 19:43.908
You shall become the Count's servant!

19:48.086 --> 19:49.781
It's no good. I can't do it...

19:51.089 --> 19:54.560
You cannot attack your real
companions so easily!

19:54.560 --> 19:56.460
Then I'll only shoot you!

20:07.406 --> 20:10.008
I am part of the game,
yet not part of the game.

20:10.008 --> 20:12.340
How can you defeat something like me?!

20:12.778 --> 20:14.575
Now you're playing dirty!

20:14.846 --> 20:17.249
In here, I make the rules.

20:17.249 --> 20:18.546
I am a god!

20:21.286 --> 20:22.387
Mayura!

20:22.387 --> 20:24.723
If I receive this girl's lifeblood,

20:24.723 --> 20:27.453
my evil powers shall become all the greater!

20:27.726 --> 20:28.727
Stop it!

20:28.727 --> 20:31.218
Be silent and watch, boy!

20:45.844 --> 20:49.781
Why, it's none other than Nidhogg,
the evil dragon.

20:49.781 --> 20:53.683
How degrading for the bloodsucker of the world
of the gods to be masquerading as Dracula.

20:54.186 --> 20:55.312
Silence!

20:55.687 --> 20:57.889
Evil dragon Nidhogg,
who dares to speak of gods...

20:57.889 --> 21:00.915
What an unfortunate twist of fate that
you should abduct these two.

21:01.260 --> 21:04.096
At the very least, I'll close the curtain
on this little act of yours

21:04.096 --> 21:06.223
in a way befitting this whole
"video game" theme.

21:10.902 --> 21:12.604
Why you...

21:12.604 --> 21:14.071
You wretched, little...

21:14.873 --> 21:17.501
The game's over.

21:33.725 --> 21:35.784
Master Loki, are you all right?

21:36.695 --> 21:38.397
Yeah, pretty much.

21:38.397 --> 21:40.524
And I got Mayura and Kotaro back.

22:16.768 --> 22:28.737
Fukai kiri wo saite tsukiakari ga terashita michi

22:30.415 --> 22:42.160
Daremo mina mayoinagara,
samayotteru ashita e to

22:42.160 --> 22:49.368
